  "gyokuroTeaStoryTitle": "Gyokuro - \"The Jade Dew\"",
  "gyokuroTeaStory": "Gyokuro is one of Japan's most treasured green teas. Before harvest, the bushes are shaded, encouraging deep sweetness, umami, and a silky texture.\n\nIt is not a tea for rushing. Gyokuro asks for cooler water, patience, and attention, rewarding the drinker with a concentrated, almost glowing calm.",
