  "manoominTeaStoryTitle": "Manoomin - \"where the sacred lake meets the roasting fire\"",
  "manoominTeaStory": "Manoomin tea is a sacred dialogue between two distant shores.\n\nIt brings together the roasting art of traditional tea and the ancient wild rice hand-harvested from Canadian lakes by Indigenous peoples. It is not just a blend, but a harmony of earth and water, born from canoes guiding through lake mists.\n\nEvery cup offers a comforting, deeply grounding warmth, rich with toasted nuttiness, popcorn aromas, and the spirit of the northern wilderness.",
